{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the demo for Dupery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this detective deduction game, uncover information by interrogating locals. Use that information to deduce good from evil. Discover who is lying all while watching the clock, and maintaining your reputation. Put an end to the syndicate. Or get duped trying, like the rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111760/extras/f325054790ef077d6a9b47bafccb6ed7.avif?t=1761326046\" alt=\"EVIL SPREADS UNCHECKED\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111760/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.poster.avif?t=1761326046\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111760/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.webm?t=1761326046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111760/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.mp4?t=1761326046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful syndicate is operating from the shadows and must be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find clues about the mysterious figure behind it all, you must first take down the syndicates four branch leaders, and extract what little information you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding them is not a simple task however, and will require you solving many cases while maintaining your reputation. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111760/extras/9c84ddcebf4700a9f87b1a80de5f27f0.avif?t=1761326046\" alt=\"DONT GET DUPED\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111760/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.poster.avif?t=1761326046\" width=1170 height=762 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111760/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.webm?t=1761326046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111760/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.mp4?t=1761326046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil members of the syndicate must be brought to justice.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each case presents you with a board containing a selection of suspects from <strong>over 30 roles</strong> that you must investigate and learn from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all the information and tools at your finger tips to figure out who is lying, and who is evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, arresting good folk will ruin your reputation and eventually get you fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, play through the first region and learn the basics of a detective in this roguelike 'clock-like' deduction game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111760?t=1761326046","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111760?t=1761326046","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111760/115d182c672a07bd5c5b13cd5921fea9d1595457/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761326046","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111760/115d182c672a07bd5c5b